{"nodes": [{"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_what_is_the_method_preface_insert", "label": "Preface insert \u2014 'What is the method?' (full draft)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-preface-what-is-the-method.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_what_is_the_method_one_question", "label": "The method is a single question \u2014 are there any more questions left to ask?", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-preface-what-is-the-method.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A question here is one the material itself poses, not one someone happens to raise."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_what_is_the_method_four_moves", "label": "The four moves \u2014 build the index, close it, read the defect, record every failure", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-preface-what-is-the-method.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The record of failures is not an apology; it is the evidence the method works."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_what_is_the_method_closure_operator_pedigree", "label": "\u211b is a genuine closure operator \u2014 extensive, monotone, idempotent", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-preface-what-is-the-method.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The book claims no novelty for the machinery; what is new is pointing it at an index and asking for its defect."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_what_is_the_method_self_referencing", "label": "Self-referencing \u2014 a closed index contains its own definition", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-preface-what-is-the-method.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Formally \u211b(\u039b) = \u039b itself: the index is a fixed point of the operator that reconstructs it, so it IS the rule for its own membership."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_what_is_the_method_self_defending", "label": "Self-defending \u2014 a closed index carries the means to catch an error in itself", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-preface-what-is-the-method.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Because it holds more than the bare minimum needed to specify it, some quantities can be reached two ways and must agree. Self-reference defends against loss; self-defence guards against a wrong derivation."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_what_is_the_method_e_vs_q", "label": "E(X) = 0 and Q(X) = \u2205 kept apart", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-preface-what-is-the-method.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An index can be structurally closed and still have open questions of the second kind; \u039b had E = 0 from Chapter 7 onward and took far longer to run out of questions."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_what_is_the_method_no_predictions", "label": "An index may be complete, or predictive; it cannot be both", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-preface-what-is-the-method.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The number of predictions an index can make is exactly E(X), so a complete index can propose nothing."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_what_is_the_method_title_page_equation", "label": "The title-page equation \u2014 E(X) = 0, the three-way split, and \u211b(\u039b) = \u039b", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-preface-what-is-the-method.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_what_is_the_method_split_6912", "label": "6,912 = 976 + 0 + 5,936 \u2014 present, implied-but-missing, and refused", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-preface-what-is-the-method.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_what_is_the_method_two_faces", "label": "The two faces \u2014 the method brackets measurements and tests whether a subject is fully indexed", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-preface-what-is-the-method.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Where the method declines to speak, its silence is itself a measurement: the order broke, the cell is absent, or the resolution failed."}], "edges": [{"source": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_what_is_the_method_preface_insert", "target": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_what_is_the_method_one_question", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-preface-what-is-the-method.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_what_is_the_method_preface_insert", "target": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_preface_what_is_the_method_four_moves", "relation": "references", "confidence"